            "text": "<p>Driveways require 5\" of aggregate on a compact surface.  We recommend #54 stone (not sold online yet)  or similar product with 4\" base.  Add 1\" of our pea gravel/aggregate and pour Klingstone Path Material evenly at 1 gallon per 10 square feet.  Use stones, pavers, wood or metal as permanent edging or use our HP Non Stick Form.</p>",
