            "title": "Path",
            "text": "<p>Paths require 3\" of aggregate on a compact surface to get a durable and beautiful surface.  Use a roller, tamp or 2 x 6\" to level and make your surface smooth.  Pour Klingstone Path Material evenly at a rate of 1 gallon per 12 square feet.  Use stones, pavers, wood or metal as permanent edging or use our HP Non Stick Form.</p>",
